codex
The launcher failure is caused by the container PID namespace: Lean asks `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, but this environment exposes only `/proc/self/exe` for that process. I’ll use a temporary preload shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup. This does not alter Lean, Lake, the project, or proof checking; it only restores the path query the binaries require.
